# kalived local IDS rules. No drop, no reject, no exploit payload bytes.
# Emerging Threats Open comes from suricata-update after ja apt (not vendored).

# DNS to .onion — string match, not shellcode/content-bytes.
alert dns $HOME_NET any -> any any (msg:"KALIVED DNS onion"; dns.query; content:".onion"; nocase; sid:7500001; rev:1;)
